[[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative (-) terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235042\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Raise the car.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the air conditioner\ncompressor electromagnet.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air conditioning compressor &quot;on&quot; electromagnet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236734\">L20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013568.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237557\">1072B50</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the right cylinder\nhead ignition coils.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Ignition coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235073\">A30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013569.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the left cylinder\nhead ignition coils.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Ignition coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235073\">A30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013570.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the injectors, then\nmove the wiring to the side.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237063\">N70</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013571.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Undo nut (1a) and disconnect earth lead (1b) from the left cylinder\nhead.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Earth on engine</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235392\">C40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect electrical connections (2a) and (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Front/engine connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235559\">D4A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Front/engine connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235577\">D4B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013572.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Unscrew bolts (1a) and move connector bracket (1b).</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection for the detonation sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Knock sensor - 2</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236585\">K51</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connection for the rpm and timing sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Rpm sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236554\">K46</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Disconnect the electrical connection for the cam angle sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236565\">K47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013573.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the air flow meter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236533\">K41</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013574.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the combined sender\nunit for the coolant temperature gauge and overheating warning light.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Coolant temperature sender unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236506\">K35</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection from the engine coolant\ntemperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Engine temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236549\">K45</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013575.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>Disconnect the electrical connection for\nthe Lambda sensor and release the wiring from the bands.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236525\">K40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237453\">1008C10</a></p><p>1. Working from the passenger compartment, undo the bolts (1a) and\nremove the injection-ignition  guard (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013576.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the injection-ignition\nelectronic control unit.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the disconnection order:\nD - E - F - C - B - A.</p></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236789\">M10</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013577.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the fuel vapour cut-out\nsolenoid valve from the filter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Fuel vapour recovery solenoid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236719\">L10</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013578.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Undo bolts (1a) and remove the right windscreen base trim (1b)\nafter disconnecting from the washer spray pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013579.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Undo bolts (1a) securing wiring (1b) to the engine bay bulkhead,\nthen remove.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013580.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Replace the system wiring loom and pull\nthrough the hole in the engine bulkhead, then secure using the bolts.</p><p>Connect the windscreen base trim to the\nwindscreen washer spray pipe, then fit and secure using the bolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nfuel vapour cut-out solenoid valve.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\ninjection-ignition control unit.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the connection order: A\n- B - C - F - E - D.</p></aside><p>Fit the injection-ignition control unit\nprotection and bolt in place.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237453\">1008C10</a></p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nLambda sensor and fix the electrical wiring to the retaining collars.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nengine coolant temperature sensor.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\ncombined sender unit for the coolant temperature gauge and overheating\nwarning light.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nair flow meter.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\ncam angle sensor.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nrpm and timing sensor.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\ndetonation sensor.</p><p>Place the connector bracket back in its\nhousing and fix it using the bolts.</p><p>Connect the front engine junction electrical\nconnections.</p><p>Connect the earth lead to the left cylinder\nhead and secure using the nut.</p><p>Replace the wiring, then connect the electrical\nconnections to the injectors.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nignition coils.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237557\">1072B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a></p><p>Raise the car.</p><p>Connect the electical connection for the\nair conditioning compressor electromagnet.</p><p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"],[2,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235042\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Disconnect electrical connections (1a) to the injectors, (1b)\nto the variable valve timing actuator, (1c) to the air flow meter,\n(1d) from the air temperature sensor, (1e) to the idle actuator.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237063\">N70</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Timing variator actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237129\">N76</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236533\">K41</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Air temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236547\">K42</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1e</p></td><td><p>Idle actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237119\">N74</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the fuel manifold plastic protection.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014120.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection to the compressor electromagnet\ncoupling.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air conditioning compressor &quot;on&quot; electromagnet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236734\">L20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014121.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p>1. Unscrew the retaining bolts and remove the coil cover.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014122.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the ignition coils.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Ignition coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235073\">A30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014123.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect collars (1a) and remove air intake pipe section (1b)\ncomplete with flow meter.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014124.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the nut (1a) and disconnect the earth lead (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Earth on engine</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235392\">C40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect electrical connections (2a)  and (2b) from the thermostat.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Engine temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236549\">K45</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Coolant temperature sender unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236506\">K35</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014125.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect electrical connection (1a) from the lambda probe and\nelectrical connection (1b) from the throttle position sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236525\">K40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Throttle position sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236597\">K56</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014126.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the throttle cable from the fastening points on the\nthrottle body.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014127.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p>1. Unscrew the bolts securing the wiring channel located beneath\nthe intake manifold.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014128.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p>1. Unscrew bolt (1a), open clip  (1b) and release fuel lines (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014129.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect electrical connections (1a)- (1b)- (1c)-(1d).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Front/engine connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235556\">D4</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Rpm sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236554\">K46</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236565\">K47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Detonation sensor - 1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236577\">K50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014130.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237453\">1008C10</a></p><p>1. Remove the injector wiring plastic protection.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014131.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,127,0,"<p>Working from inside the car, remove the\nplastic protection of the i.e. control unit.</p><p>1. Disconnect the single connector from the i.e. control unit</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236789\">M10</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../